WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.231 --> 00:00:04.000
My daughter

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.203
a new threat comes to our shores

00:00:07.203 --> 00:00:09.405
and I must call you home.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.476
Restore what has been broken.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.713
Unite old enemies.

00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:19.382
Forge new bonds.

00:00:20.049 --> 00:00:22.585
You are a hero,

00:00:22.585 --> 00:00:24.754
but you can be more.

00:00:25.922 --> 00:00:29.225
You can be a leader.

00:00:30.593 --> 00:00:34.330
You are Wonder Woman

